    description: "The pink rose between the Bedroom 1 window and ensuite corner is securely a Rosa but not yet safely assignable to a cultivar or even a precise garden class. Its June-to-September flowering suggests repeat performance, while flower form, scent, hips, thorn pattern and mature habit still need recording. Until those clues are captured, care stays deliberately conservative: train only obvious structural shoots and avoid class-specific hard pruning.",
