    under: "leaf margins browning and soft extensions wilting in prolonged drought", over: "weak pale growth where roots remain waterlogged", spring: "Mulch and allow the red flush to develop before removing any winter damage.", summer: "Water young roots in drought and thin only a few badly placed stems after flowers finish.", autumn: "Record foliage colour and allow leaves to fall before judging the permanent framework.", winter: "Remove a minority of oldest stems at ground level only when the mature shrub becomes congested.",
