    months: ["Jun", "Jul", "Aug"], size: "30–50cm high", sizeDetail: "Spreads roughly 50–100cm", position: "Sun or light shade", positionDetail: "Fuller sun strengthens gold and red colour", soil: "Adaptable and drained", soilDetail: "Moist but well-drained in most soil types", hardiness: "H6", hardinessDetail: "Fully hardy", feature: "Gold leaves, red tips and pink flowers", featureDetail: "Colour changes from spring to autumn", identity: "Magic Carpet (‘Walbuma’)", identityDetail: "Trade name and cultivar confirmed",
