    description: "Delosperma Ice Cream Mix spreads as a low mat of narrow succulent leaves across the sunniest open ground. Daisy flowers in cream, pink, orange and yellow open in bright warmth from summer into autumn, closing when light fades. Its water-storing foliage makes winter wet the decisive risk: the crown should sit above surrounding soil in mineral drainage, not beneath the richer moisture regime used for the Astrantias.",
